    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like i'm drowning lately. everything is so expensive and i'm working so hard but it feels like we're just getting deeper in debt. i look at my wife and the kids and i just feel like a weight around their necks. like i'm just dragging them down with me.",
